    {
      "text": "Breaches are asymmetric: the market breaks the downside less often but further (crash risk the sellers are paid for)",
      "claim_source": "lit:vrp",
      "tasty_value": "Normal equity skew is negative: OTM puts are richer because of hedging demand",
      "tasty_sources": [
        "page:concepts-volatility-skew"
